Just a quick FYI for a small number of people.

There was a post a while back that said some folks (myself included) were 
having issues with thrown objects not sorting correctly into their packs.  
Take 5 +0 daggers (b), throw 2 of them to different places and they are 
picked up and each gets a new letter label...i.e. first one becomes "c", 
next one "d".  So afterwards you end up with 3 +0 daggers (b), 1 + dagger 
(c), 1 +0 dagger (d). 

I was fooling around with this and found that the pickupthrown option on 
the extended options screen fixes this.  Set the option to True to have 
thrown objects stack into the original letter designation.

